      <ID>ZVSSJAD_JOB_CONFIRMED</ID>
      <VERSION>A</VERSION>
      <LANGU>E</LANGU>
      <BODY_TXT>Dear Customer,
Thank you very much for the confirmation!
The additional job for the vehicle {LIC_PLATE}, will be carried out at the estimated cost of {COST} {CURRENCY}.
Job description: {JOB_DESCRIPTION}
We look forward to seeing you!
Best Regards
changed your mind? &amp;rarr;</BODY_TXT>
